 "world": "Healthcare compliance evaluations were conducted across multiple facilities to assess regulatory standards, staffing levels, safety protocols, and contract eligibility.",
 "rationale": {
  "m_57b7": [
   "Apex Health System employs 12 certified HIPAA compliance officers, meeting the 10-officer threshold, and logged 4 privacy incidents last year, remaining under the limit of 5."
